---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const updated = "10 August 2026";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | EV Charge Nepal"
  description="How EV Charge Nepal handles location access, analytics, cookies, and your privacy when you search EV charging stations in Nepal."
  canonical="/privacy/"
>
  <article class="prose-legal mx-auto max-w-[820px] px-6 py-12">
    <p class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.08em] text-charge uppercase">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="font-display mb-3 text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem)] font-extrabold tracking-tight">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>
    <p class="mb-8 text-sm text-muted">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-muted">
      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-paper">1. Who we are</h2>
        <p>
          EV Charge Nepal (“we”, “us”) provides a public website that helps people find electric
          vehicle charging stations across Nepal. This Privacy Policy explains what information we
          collect and how we use it.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-paper">2. Information we collect</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
          <li>
            <strong class="text-paper">Location (optional):</strong> If you allow browser location
            access, your device coordinates are used locally in your browser to sort nearby
            stations. We do not require an account for this feature.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-paper">Usage data:</strong> Standard server or hosting logs may
            include IP address, browser type, pages visited, and timestamps.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-paper">Contact messages:</strong> If you email or contact us, we
            receive the content you send (such as name, email, and message).
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-paper">Cookies / local storage:</strong> The site may use essential
            storage for preferences or map state. We do not use advertising cookies to sell personal
            profiles.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-paper">3. How we use information</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
          <li>To show and improve the charging station map and search experience</li>
          <li>To sort stations by distance when location is enabled</li>
          <li>To respond to support or listing correction requests</li>
          <li>To maintain security, diagnose errors, and understand aggregate traffic</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-paper">4. Sharing</h2>
        <p>
          We do not sell your personal information. We may share limited data with service providers
          who host the website or help us operate it, only as needed to provide the service. We may
          also disclose information if required by law.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Third-party maps (for example Google Maps directions links or OpenStreetMap tiles) are
          governed by those providers’ own privacy policies when you open or load their services.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-paper">5. Data retention</h2>
        <p>
          Browser location used for nearby sorting is processed on your device for that session and
          is not stored in an EV Charge Nepal account. Contact messages and server logs are kept only
          as long as needed for support, security, and operations.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-paper">6. Your choices</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
          <li>Deny or revoke location permission in your browser settings at any time.</li>
          <li>Clear cookies and site data from your browser.</li>
          <li>Contact us to request deletion of messages you previously sent.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-paper">7. Children</h2>
        <p>
          The site is a general public information tool and is not directed at children under 13. We
          do not knowingly collect personal information from children.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-paper">8. Changes</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this policy from time to time. The “Last updated” date at the top will
          change when we publish revisions.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-paper">9. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about privacy:
          <a href="/contact/" class="font-semibold text-charge hover:underline">Contact page</a>
          or email
          <a href="mailto:privacy@evcharge.np" class="font-semibold text-charge hover:underline"
            >privacy@evcharge.np</a
          >.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
